      en: "The Qəbələ region is known not only for its ancient history and mountain landscapes, but also as one of the most important centers for hazelnut cultivation in Azerbaijan. The country is one of the world's leading hazelnut producers, and the plantations in Qəbələ contribute significantly to this. The region's fertile soils and temperate climate provide ideal conditions for growing high-quality hazelnuts. The extensive plantations shape the rural landscape and are an important economic factor for the local population. The late summer harvest is a labor-intensive period that employs many seasonal workers. Azerbaijani hazelnuts are highly valued both on the domestic market and for export."
